WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:52.346
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:52.616 --> 00:56.243
[Episode 4. Too Easy or Utterly Impossible]

3
00:56.243 --> 00:57.709
Jin, let's hear it.

4
00:59.204 --> 01:02.291
Hello, I'm Carol.

5
01:02.291 --> 01:04.493
Nice to meet you.

6
01:05.252 --> 01:08.299
Well? Is this voice no good either?

7
01:09.640 --> 01:14.736
So your tastes, even your favorite colors... You let other people choose for you?

8
01:14.736 --> 01:16.346
By the way, Jin,

9
01:16.346 --> 01:18.986
what do you think her favorite color is?

10
01:18.986 --> 01:20.761
Her favorite color?

11
01:34.239 --> 01:37.515
I bet he's cooped up in there again.

12
01:37.515 --> 01:40.820
If he's going to make me work late, he should at least feed me.

13
01:46.627 --> 01:48.468
How can I not hear a thing?

14
01:56.554 --> 01:58.933
Right. It's soundproofed.

15
02:02.809 --> 02:03.977
Hello?

16
02:03.977 --> 02:05.187
Hey.

17
02:05.854 --> 02:07.606
Working late again? Don't tell me.

18
02:07.606 --> 02:08.899
Yeah.

19
02:08.899 --> 02:11.652
Can I sleep at the club tonight?

20
02:11.652 --> 02:13.862
Why? What's going on?

21
02:13.862 --> 02:16.482
I was a little late for curfew last night,

22
02:16.482 --> 02:20.410
and my dad came at me with the clippers.

23
02:20.410 --> 02:22.913
I'm not in high school anymore.

24
02:22.913 --> 02:26.416
This is my chance to show him that I'm a real adult

25
02:26.416 --> 02:29.127
who can make my own choices and act on them.

26
02:29.127 --> 02:31.505
So you want to sleep at the club?

27
02:31.505 --> 02:33.131
Just sleep at my place.

28
02:33.131 --> 02:34.758
I'll sleep at the club instead.

29
02:34.758 --> 02:37.344
Sleep at your place?

30
02:37.344 --> 02:42.287
Dong Woo, this is why you're our leader.

31
02:43.433 --> 02:44.594
Thanks.

32
02:48.100 --> 02:49.280
Oh, my!

33
02:53.652 --> 02:55.112
Why on earth

34
02:55.112 --> 02:57.364
are you eavesdropping on my call?

35
02:57.364 --> 02:59.616
Who's eavesdropping?

36
02:59.616 --> 03:01.410
You're the one talking so loud.

37
03:01.410 --> 03:03.245
Was I that loud?

38
03:03.245 --> 03:05.789
I thought it was soundproof.

39
03:05.789 --> 03:07.165
Go home tonight.

40
03:07.165 --> 03:09.167
Your father's the only one to trust.

41
03:09.167 --> 03:12.587
So even if he shaves your head, sleep at home.

42
03:16.758 --> 03:18.301
You're going home, right?

43
03:22.264 --> 03:23.849
Not telling.

44
03:42.284 --> 03:43.618
Where are you?

45
03:43.618 --> 03:45.412
Why are you picking up?

46
03:45.412 --> 03:46.830
Are you with Jin Woo?

47
03:46.830 --> 03:48.632
Why are you looking for him?

48
03:48.632 --> 03:51.334
And you stayed out all night. Have you lost your mind?

49
03:51.334 --> 03:53.871
I'm perfectly sane. That's why I need him.

50
03:53.871 --> 03:56.659
If I go home alone, I'm dead.

51
03:58.216 --> 04:00.427
Eun Chae, where are you?

52
04:00.427 --> 04:02.596
We're arriving at Father's house now.

53
04:02.596 --> 04:03.930
Really?

54
04:03.930 --> 04:06.224
Then I'll wait outside.

55
04:06.224 --> 04:07.851
Okay, got it.

56
04:07.851 --> 04:09.221
Okay.

57
04:18.487 --> 04:20.489
Sleep at your place?

58
04:20.489 --> 04:23.934
Dong Woo.

59
04:23.934 --> 04:25.549
Don't tell me...

60
04:33.877 --> 04:35.892
What am I doing here?

61
04:52.354 --> 04:54.189
- It's fine. - What do you mean?

62
04:54.189 --> 04:55.607
- Hey! - Eun Chae.

63
04:55.607 --> 04:56.901
Get over here, now.

64
04:58.912 --> 05:00.099
- Stop. - Hopeless.

65
05:00.099 --> 05:01.488
- Get over here. - Let's go.

66
05:01.488 --> 05:03.698
- Where did you sleep? - It really hurts.

67
05:03.698 --> 05:05.242
Where did you sleep?

68
05:05.242 --> 05:08.745
That's not the point right now. Dad's going to kill me.

69
05:08.745 --> 05:10.122
Just come on. Hurry.

70
05:10.122 --> 05:12.680
You're going to beat me to death at this rate.

71
05:16.002 --> 05:19.297
My back is going to give out.

72
05:26.638 --> 05:28.056
Father.

73
05:28.056 --> 05:29.141
Dad.

74
05:29.141 --> 05:31.620
- You're here. - Were you resting?

75
05:35.522 --> 05:38.483
You little brat! How dare you stay out all night?

76
05:38.483 --> 05:41.017
You were holding the clippers, so I ran away.

77
05:41.017 --> 05:44.698
- How dare you talk back to me? - Father, please calm down.

78
05:44.698 --> 05:47.159
She's a grown woman. You can't shave her head.

79
05:47.159 --> 05:50.412
Yeah, Dad. Look at her face.

80
05:50.412 --> 05:53.081
Her hair is the only thing that makes her look decent.

81
05:53.081 --> 05:54.374
That's not true.

82
05:54.374 --> 05:56.334
Mom said I have a nicely shaped head.

83
05:56.334 --> 06:00.130
Mom was just being nice because you get hurt so easily.

84
06:00.130 --> 06:02.048
- It's true. - Wait,

85
06:02.048 --> 06:03.550
why play favorites, Dad?

86
06:03.550 --> 06:06.344
You never threatened to shave Eun Seo's!

87
06:06.344 --> 06:09.306
Dad! Just shave her head already!

88
06:09.306 --> 06:11.075
Both of you, be quiet!

89
06:18.190 --> 06:21.452
Honey, I'm sorry.

90
06:21.452 --> 06:24.123
I must have raised them wrong.

91
06:26.323 --> 06:30.487
I guess my hair's time is up, too.

92
06:31.530 --> 06:33.477
- I'll just shave mine. - Dad.

93
06:33.477 --> 06:35.977
- Father! - Dad!

94
06:37.167 --> 06:39.711
Seriously, why are you doing this?

95
06:39.711 --> 06:41.171
- Please! - Don't do it!

96
06:41.171 --> 06:44.366
Please, Father. Please stop, please!

97
06:48.136 --> 06:50.680
This year's financials for Seheon Hotel Resort.

98
06:50.680 --> 06:53.099
Reviewing them first will help in the meeting.

99
06:53.099 --> 06:57.729
Why does he want me handling that, too?

100
06:57.729 --> 07:01.399
The chairman plans to expand the resort business this year.

101
07:01.399 --> 07:05.654
I believe he wants you to take control of it.

102
07:05.654 --> 07:08.521
So again, why should I...

103
07:18.124 --> 07:20.543
After the resort team meeting this afternoon,

104
07:20.543 --> 07:24.047
you have dinner with directors of the hotel we're looking to buy.

105
07:24.047 --> 07:27.759
You'll probably have to go straight home from your meetings today.

106
07:27.759 --> 07:29.052
What about the agency?

107
07:29.052 --> 07:31.263
I've moved all your Wednesday meetings.

108
07:31.263 --> 07:33.430
- It's Wednesday today? - Yes.

109
07:46.945 --> 07:48.780
Yes, Mr. Park.

110
07:48.780 --> 07:53.285
Eun Chae, I'm out with the CEO.

111
07:53.285 --> 07:57.664
It'll be past 9:00 PM when we're done, so report to me if anything comes up.

112
07:57.664 --> 07:59.607
Yes, I understand.

113
08:02.585 --> 08:06.006
So he won't be back till late?

114
08:06.006 --> 08:08.712
Looks like I can make the show tonight.

115
08:26.735 --> 08:30.328
Watch where you're going! You scared me half to death!

116
08:31.364 --> 08:32.615
Excuse you.

117
08:32.615 --> 08:36.447
You're the one who should be careful on a street like this, not me.

118
08:37.871 --> 08:39.456
This was expensive.

119
08:39.456 --> 08:41.249
Let me take you to the hospital.

120
08:41.249 --> 08:43.752
I'm fine. Just go.

121
08:43.752 --> 08:45.674
Just be careful next time.

122
08:46.459 --> 08:47.464
Just go?

123
08:47.464 --> 08:51.080
No way. What if you report me for a hit-and-run later?

124
08:53.011 --> 08:55.472
Give me your phone. I'll put my number in.

125
08:55.472 --> 08:56.690
Your number?

126
08:59.343 --> 09:01.595
Is this how you hit on people?

127
09:03.563 --> 09:06.107
Well, if that's what you think, I'll just leave.

128
09:06.107 --> 09:07.385
Goodbye.

129
09:07.385 --> 09:08.961
No, give it to me!

130
09:10.445 --> 09:12.072
Give it to me!

131
09:12.072 --> 09:13.501
Your number.

132
09:27.921 --> 09:30.470
Drive carefully next time. Seriously.

133
09:38.587 --> 09:41.267
Next, we'll discuss what sets OYES apart.

134
09:41.267 --> 09:44.521
First, a diversified artist portfolio.

135
09:44.521 --> 09:50.110
We mitigate risk with a balanced lineup of singers, actors, and creators.

136
09:50.110 --> 09:53.670
Second, our in-house content production capabilities.

137
09:55.490 --> 09:57.147
Okay.

138
09:58.536 --> 10:01.392
Time to clock out.

139
10:07.708 --> 10:10.841
Don't even think about leaving. Keep working.

140
10:13.341 --> 10:16.624
He's a mind reader. Is he watching me or something?

141
10:19.889 --> 10:21.922
Of course. I'm working.

142
10:23.226 --> 10:24.644
Too bad, though.

143
10:24.644 --> 10:26.697
I'm stepping out for a bit.

144
10:35.305 --> 10:38.892
Then go to my room and open the last drawer on the right.

145
10:38.892 --> 10:40.243
What's in there?

146
10:40.243 --> 10:41.953
Ugh.

147
10:41.953 --> 10:43.413
Seriously.

148
10:44.956 --> 10:47.541
The last drawer on the right.

149
10:51.626 --> 10:53.322
It's locked.

150
10:53.926 --> 10:55.717
Correct.

151
10:55.717 --> 10:57.400
What in the...

152
10:58.026 --> 10:59.538
Stand by.

153
11:04.669 --> 11:07.814
Now, open the first drawer on the left.

154
11:13.171 --> 11:15.485
This one's locked too.

155
11:15.485 --> 11:17.169
Correct.

156
11:30.502 --> 11:33.262
Forget it, forget it, forget it!

157
11:43.473 --> 11:45.039
Wait a second...

158
11:59.082 --> 12:02.154
Open the closet by the window. What's in there?

159
12:03.109 --> 12:04.769
A shirt.

160
12:08.699 --> 12:10.050
Correct.

161
12:10.625 --> 12:12.043
Let's see.

162
12:13.127 --> 12:14.377
Here.

163
12:18.007 --> 12:19.549
Perfect.

164
12:50.206 --> 12:53.042
I'll be back after dinner.

165
13:00.941 --> 13:02.979
[Donghun Chicken, Hongdae Branch]

166
13:09.225 --> 13:10.894
Step on it.

167
13:10.894 --> 13:12.604
To Hongdae.

168
13:44.719 --> 13:46.304
I'll be going now.

169
13:46.304 --> 13:48.097
Pardon?

170
13:48.097 --> 13:49.599
Sir!

171
13:52.560 --> 13:54.062
Sir.

172
13:54.062 --> 13:55.440
Sir!

173
14:23.758 --> 14:25.921
We're India Red!

174
14:25.921 --> 14:26.928
Thank you!

175
14:26.928 --> 14:29.180
Make some noise!

176
14:37.480 --> 14:40.608
Wow, how many times did he call?

177
14:41.693 --> 14:43.736
Is the music too loud?

178
14:48.866 --> 14:50.618
Don't be scared.

179
14:50.618 --> 14:52.606
I just came out for dinner.

180
14:58.289 --> 14:59.449
Where are you?

181
15:00.253 --> 15:01.963
Where do you think?

182
15:01.963 --> 15:03.881
Didn't you see the photo?

183
15:03.881 --> 15:05.550
I'm out for dinner.

184
15:05.550 --> 15:06.866
Are you in the office?

185
15:07.427 --> 15:09.137
You came out for dinner?

186
15:09.137 --> 15:10.509
What did you eat?

187
15:16.144 --> 15:17.978
You really came.

188
15:20.958 --> 15:22.564
I didn't take off my makeup.

189
15:32.952 --> 15:34.332
Well...

190
15:35.913 --> 15:40.418
I wasn't trying to fool you.

191
15:40.418 --> 15:42.136
You? Fool me?

192
15:48.050 --> 15:49.427
Fine!

193
15:49.427 --> 15:51.095
I'm Soo!

194
15:51.095 --> 15:54.307
So what? What are you going to do about it?

195
15:54.307 --> 15:55.464
By the way,

196
15:56.059 --> 15:58.401
why do you want to meet Soo so badly?

197
15:59.187 --> 16:01.314
You said you'd tell Soo yourself.

198
16:01.314 --> 16:05.302
Now that you know I'm Soo, go ahead and tell me.

199
16:10.406 --> 16:14.535
Does a man need a reason to want to meet a woman?

200
16:14.535 --> 16:18.731
But now that I know Soo is you, Lee Eun Chae,

201
16:20.249 --> 16:22.585
focus only on work for the next three months.

202
16:22.585 --> 16:24.962
100,000 won a day. 30 days, three million.

203
16:24.962 --> 16:27.006
Three months, nine million.

204
16:27.006 --> 16:29.634
Plus another million, and that's exactly ten million.

205
16:29.634 --> 16:31.719
Don't I get any days off?

206
16:31.719 --> 16:34.972
You're such a labor-law-breaking slave driver.

207
16:34.972 --> 16:38.392
Then pay triple the penalty and end the contract.

208
16:38.392 --> 16:41.562
The club looked packed earlier.

209
16:41.562 --> 16:43.064
I think you can afford it.

210
16:43.064 --> 16:45.399
You're so petty.

211
16:45.399 --> 16:49.027
How would an indie band singer have that kind of money?

212
16:51.113 --> 16:52.657
Better yet,

213
16:52.657 --> 16:56.369
how about living together for three days instead of a three-month contract?

214
16:56.369 --> 17:00.790
If you don't lay a finger on me for three days, you win.

215
17:00.790 --> 17:05.549
If I win, clear the ten million and apologize to me on top of it.

216
17:06.921 --> 17:10.758
This is why your father keeps the hair clippers ready.

217
17:13.761 --> 17:15.406
Besides,

218
17:15.406 --> 17:18.850
living together makes the game too easy.

219
17:18.850 --> 17:22.478
Easy games bore me. It'd be like shooting fish in a barrel.

220
17:22.478 --> 17:25.951
I'm saying I won't fall for you even if we live together.

221
17:26.858 --> 17:29.443
That bet still stands, right?

222
17:29.443 --> 17:32.515
If I don't fall for you,

223
17:34.477 --> 17:36.492
you'll give me what I want.

224
17:36.492 --> 17:39.704
If you fall for me, you give me what I want.

225
17:42.415 --> 17:45.376
Contracts are made to be kept.

226
17:45.376 --> 17:46.419
Deal?

227
17:46.419 --> 17:47.576
Deal!

228
18:06.647 --> 18:09.317
That bet still stands, right?

229
18:09.317 --> 18:13.362
If I don't fall for you,

230
18:13.362 --> 18:15.197
you'll give me what I want.

231
18:15.197 --> 18:18.659
If you fall for me, you give me what I want.

232
18:18.659 --> 18:21.412
I need to win this bet.

233
18:21.412 --> 18:24.206
Then I can get rid of Soo.

234
18:30.963 --> 18:34.649
I'm saying I won't fall for you even if we live together.

235
18:36.552 --> 18:37.803
Unbelievable.

236
18:37.803 --> 18:40.259
How can she be so confident?

237
18:44.518 --> 18:46.437
But...

238
18:46.437 --> 18:49.899
I've shown her everything. What more could she want?

239
18:56.822 --> 18:59.200
- Theo. - Yes, boss.

240
18:59.200 --> 19:02.662
I need data on the kind of men women fall for.

241
19:02.662 --> 19:06.415
Well, I'm sure I'm perfect according to the data.

242
19:06.415 --> 19:09.167
You are perfect on paper, boss, but...

243
19:09.167 --> 19:10.167
But?

244
19:10.167 --> 19:11.961
Women want attention to detail.

245
19:11.961 --> 19:15.091
Like a surprise gift just for her.

246
19:15.091 --> 19:17.271
So it's about money after all.

247
19:22.139 --> 19:24.425
But it's not just about the money.

248
19:34.193 --> 19:37.924
Come here. 1st floor, 345 Cheongdam-dong.

249
19:47.325 --> 19:50.900
345 Cheongdam-dong, 1st floor.

250
19:51.502 --> 19:52.962
This is the place.

251
19:53.546 --> 19:56.340
What is he up to now?

252
20:18.656 --> 20:20.617
Hello.

253
20:21.949 --> 20:24.744
I'm here to see someone.

254
20:24.744 --> 20:26.412
This way, please.

255
20:36.353 --> 20:39.091
It's my lunch break. Why did you call me out here?

256
20:39.091 --> 20:40.259
And...

257
20:40.259 --> 20:42.887
why come here when you've got no woman to buy for?

258
20:42.887 --> 20:47.291
Whether I do or not isn't something you'd know.

259
21:08.037 --> 21:09.455
Want me to buy it for you?

260
21:09.455 --> 21:12.319
Really? How much is it?

261
21:12.319 --> 21:14.835
[9.5 million won]

262
21:14.835 --> 21:16.337
Holy cow!

263
21:16.337 --> 21:18.923
No, Lee Eun Chae. Get a grip.

264
21:18.923 --> 21:21.289
There's no such thing as a free lunch.

265
21:22.009 --> 21:23.344
No, forget it.

266
21:23.344 --> 21:24.454
I don't need it.

267
21:24.454 --> 21:26.180
Think of it as a gift.

268
21:26.180 --> 21:28.808
Don't women love getting gifts?

269
21:28.808 --> 21:30.935
- Wrap it up, please. - Yes, sir.

270
21:30.935 --> 21:32.603
No, get a grip.

271
21:32.603 --> 21:34.105
He's just playing games.

272
21:34.105 --> 21:35.606
No, forget it.

273
21:36.565 --> 21:38.818
I said I'm fine. I don't need it.

274
21:38.818 --> 21:41.153
If you don't need it, take it and toss it.

275
21:41.153 --> 21:43.369
I want to give it to you anyway.

276
21:44.990 --> 21:46.909
Don't try to bait me like this.

277
21:46.909 --> 21:49.430
It only makes me dislike you more.

278
22:00.756 --> 22:02.758
The data was wrong.

279
22:02.758 --> 22:04.922
Look in the mirror, boss.

280
22:08.030 --> 22:09.056
What do you mean?

281
22:09.056 --> 22:12.404
Here are the moments women fall for men.

282
22:15.084 --> 22:17.312
[Moments when a woman falls for a man]

283
22:17.940 --> 22:20.930
Do they really fall for things like this?

284
22:22.862 --> 22:24.138
Why?

285
22:55.686 --> 22:59.848
When he unbuttons his white shirt, rolls up his sleeves, and focuses on work.

286
23:10.993 --> 23:12.893
You're not sick, are you?

287
23:13.704 --> 23:15.539
What?

288
23:17.458 --> 23:19.543
I don't like where this is.

289
23:19.543 --> 23:21.117
It needs to move.

290
23:24.298 --> 23:28.748
When she sees the veins pop on his forearms as he moves something heavy.

291
23:29.762 --> 23:32.192
She looks smitten already.

292
23:37.853 --> 23:40.773
I think the original spot was better.

293
23:40.773 --> 23:41.857
Really?

294
23:45.633 --> 23:47.806
How about here?

295
23:58.999 --> 24:00.892
When he pats her on the head.

296
24:01.882 --> 24:03.758
A head pat?

297
24:07.883 --> 24:09.218
It means stroking someone,

298
24:09.218 --> 24:14.598
the way an owner shows affection by petting a dog or a cat.

299
24:14.598 --> 24:17.017
Time for the finishing touch.

300
24:17.017 --> 24:18.441
There, there.

301
24:23.732 --> 24:25.297
What was that?

302
24:26.068 --> 24:27.528
Well...

303
24:28.696 --> 24:32.408
Why are you touching my hair? Why did you mess it up?

304
24:32.408 --> 24:35.577
Ugh, this took more effort than you'd think!

305
24:35.577 --> 24:37.759
You're such a weirdo!

306
24:43.002 --> 24:46.463
Is this a data error? Or...

307
24:46.463 --> 24:49.421
is Lee Eun Chae the error in the data?

308
25:02.699 --> 25:04.085
What are you doing?

309
25:05.399 --> 25:08.569
You're throwing this away, right?

310
25:08.569 --> 25:10.779
Well, yes, but...

311
25:10.779 --> 25:13.282
Then mind if I listen to it?

312
25:14.575 --> 25:16.513
Did the CEO ask for it?

313
25:17.661 --> 25:20.247
So what's going on with you and the CEO?

314
25:20.247 --> 25:23.000
He's the CEO, and I'm his secretary.

315
25:23.000 --> 25:26.188
It's just... I saw you two come in together that morning.

316
25:27.463 --> 25:30.007
We just had breakfast together.

317
25:30.007 --> 25:31.175
Is that a problem?

318
25:31.175 --> 25:33.220
No, not at all.

319
25:34.170 --> 25:35.900
What's going on?

320
25:35.900 --> 25:37.665
It's nothing, Director Oh.

321
25:38.349 --> 25:41.393
The CEO's new secretary. Must have pulled some strings.

322
25:41.393 --> 25:44.563
She had breakfast with the CEO and came in with him.

323
25:44.563 --> 25:47.608
Do secretaries usually have breakfast with their bosses?

324
25:47.608 --> 25:49.943
So they must have met at dawn, right?

325
25:49.943 --> 25:51.837
Isn't it strange?

326
25:54.948 --> 25:57.814
Can't believe she's saying that loud enough for me to hear.

327
26:15.427 --> 26:18.430
You're working harder than I expected.

328
26:18.430 --> 26:22.064
If you're cut out for this business, you could stay for good.

329
26:29.260 --> 26:31.306
Am I talking to myself?

330
26:37.116 --> 26:39.118
What now? What?

331
26:39.118 --> 26:41.036
Here to listen to music? Go home.

332
26:41.036 --> 26:42.204
Really?

333
26:42.204 --> 26:43.872
I mean straight home.

334
26:43.872 --> 26:46.370
Don't lie and sneak off somewhere else.

335
26:49.169 --> 26:52.291
Has he been possessed by my dad or something?

336
26:53.882 --> 26:55.571
Forget it. I'll take you.

337
26:56.093 --> 26:57.636
No, thanks.

338
26:57.636 --> 27:02.307
The staff already saw us come in together the other day.

339
27:02.307 --> 27:04.643
Who knows what rumors will start this time?

340
27:04.643 --> 27:06.728
We've got nothing to hide.

341
27:06.728 --> 27:08.730
Just tell them it's not true.

342
27:08.730 --> 27:11.014
You argue with me just fine.

343
27:13.738 --> 27:16.320
When I say I'm taking you, I'm taking you.

344
27:17.698 --> 27:20.951
You've been really weird lately, you know that?

345
27:20.951 --> 27:24.073
Fine, let's go.

346
27:25.664 --> 27:29.251
But I'm going home alone today.

347
27:29.251 --> 27:31.472
You're such a weirdo.

348
27:34.058 --> 27:35.531
Happy clocking out!

349
27:38.135 --> 27:40.581
Go straight home! No detours!

350
27:43.849 --> 27:47.222
Why am I acting like this?

351
28:07.156 --> 28:08.457
Do Hyeok, you're here.

352
28:08.457 --> 28:10.125
Yes.

353
28:10.125 --> 28:11.752
So why did you want me here?

354
28:12.930 --> 28:15.581
To take a family photo.

355
28:20.886 --> 28:24.139
Didn't the chairman tell you?

356
28:24.139 --> 28:27.018
He only said to stop by before going to work.

357
28:28.533 --> 28:30.938
Honestly, that man.

358
28:30.938 --> 28:34.525
Well, at least your work clothes will do for the photo.

359
28:34.525 --> 28:38.570
Mr. Park, the chairman is outside. Please bring him in.

360
28:38.570 --> 28:40.572
- Yes, ma'am. - Do Yeon.

361
28:40.572 --> 28:43.323
Gosh, what's taking her? Do Yeon.

362
28:45.661 --> 28:46.985
I'll go.

363
28:58.006 --> 28:59.841
I'm not taking the photo.

364
28:59.841 --> 29:02.261
This isn't like you. What's all this about?

365
29:02.261 --> 29:06.181
Your stepmother wants it so badly. Just go along with it.

366
29:06.181 --> 29:07.516
I...

367
29:07.516 --> 29:09.560
I'm doing everything you ask of me,

368
29:09.560 --> 29:13.021
but I don't want my face hanging in this house as part of the family.

369
29:13.021 --> 29:15.732
Your denial doesn't change the fact that we're family.

370
29:15.732 --> 29:16.984
Right.

371
29:16.984 --> 29:19.945
Just like how Mom's death doesn't disappear

372
29:19.945 --> 29:23.365
even if you burned everything that belonged to her.

373
29:23.365 --> 29:24.914
Isn't that right?

374
29:25.534 --> 29:28.245
Everyone does what they must to survive.

375
29:28.245 --> 29:31.498
Especially when money and power are involved.

376
29:31.498 --> 29:33.458
Your stepmother

377
29:33.458 --> 29:35.669
is doing that to survive, too.

378
29:35.669 --> 29:36.962
And

379
29:36.962 --> 29:39.131
this isn't the time

380
29:39.131 --> 29:42.156
to flaunt your petty pride in front of me.

381
29:46.263 --> 29:48.223
Yes, we're ready.

382
29:48.223 --> 29:49.975
Let's get started!

383
29:49.975 --> 29:51.935
Just relax and look at the lens.

384
29:51.935 --> 29:54.313
You can rest a hand there, like that.

385
29:54.313 --> 29:58.151
Let's take the shot. One, two, three!

386
30:00.557 --> 30:01.945
Ouch...

387
30:01.945 --> 30:03.363
What do we do?

388
30:03.363 --> 30:05.616
Jin Woo, I think you should carry him.

389
30:05.616 --> 30:08.410
- Me? - No! He'll hurt his back.

390
30:08.410 --> 30:10.245
The three of us can lift him.

391
30:10.245 --> 30:12.664
- Okay, okay. Father. - Hold him.

392
30:12.664 --> 30:13.957
Father, lean back.

393
30:13.957 --> 30:15.626
- Grab his legs. - The legs.

394
30:15.626 --> 30:17.794
Okay, slowly, slowly.

395
30:17.794 --> 30:19.984
One, two, three!

396
30:22.966 --> 30:24.176
Honey, are you okay?

397
30:24.176 --> 30:25.802
Honey, are you all right?

398
30:25.802 --> 30:27.429
Dad!

399
30:29.686 --> 30:32.078
I'll... I'll walk. I can do it.

400
30:32.078 --> 30:34.061
- I will. - No, Father.

401
30:34.061 --> 30:36.518
- Are you okay? Careful. - Father, I'm the doctor.

402
30:36.518 --> 30:38.145
- Be careful. - Father.

403
30:38.145 --> 30:39.725
Just trust me.

404
30:46.698 --> 30:49.409
Eun Chae's father is unwell and in the hospital.

405
30:49.409 --> 30:52.290
I'll make sure it doesn't affect your schedule.

406
30:59.437 --> 31:01.370
What's going on?

407
31:01.370 --> 31:04.337
My father hurt his back and is in the hospital.

408
31:04.337 --> 31:07.236
It can't be helped today, so cut me some slack.

409
31:08.069 --> 31:09.510
Which hospital?

410
31:10.172 --> 31:13.266
Why? Are you going to visit him?

411
31:13.266 --> 31:14.601
Why?

412
31:14.601 --> 31:17.065
Are you going to visit him?

413
31:18.605 --> 31:20.065
No.

414
31:20.065 --> 31:22.155
Just checking if you were lying.

415
31:30.283 --> 31:31.952
Dad, are you okay?

416
31:31.952 --> 31:34.037
Eun Chae.

417
31:34.037 --> 31:36.665
Bring the album when you come.

418
31:36.665 --> 31:40.252
What? Is there a song you want to hear?

419
31:40.252 --> 31:42.337
The family album.

420
31:43.714 --> 31:45.549
Why the family album?

421
31:45.549 --> 31:48.552
I'm having surgery.

422
31:48.552 --> 31:51.221
I might never see you all again.

423
31:51.221 --> 31:55.600
Come on Dad. Don't say things like that.

424
31:55.600 --> 32:00.647
I have to see you get married before I go.

425
32:00.647 --> 32:03.191
Dad.

426
32:03.191 --> 32:06.259
Why? Did the doctor say it's serious?

427
32:07.237 --> 32:08.697
Gosh.

428
32:08.697 --> 32:10.907
I heard it's just disc surgery.

429
32:10.907 --> 32:14.524
You're acting like it's a funeral.

430
32:19.666 --> 32:21.406
Don't laugh, you punk.

431
32:22.647 --> 32:24.673
Make sure to bring that album.

432
32:25.464 --> 32:28.446
Okay, okay, I will.

433
32:46.902 --> 32:51.709
You've made a habit of not replying.

434
32:51.709 --> 32:53.343
Aren't there any decent men at work?

435
32:53.343 --> 32:55.216
Not at all.

436
32:55.994 --> 32:57.871
Eun Chae, do you want a blind date?

437
32:57.871 --> 32:59.623
A blind date?

438
32:59.623 --> 33:02.005
If he's like you, Jin Woo, sure.

439
33:02.501 --> 33:05.128
My sister really lucked out.

440
33:05.128 --> 33:06.171
She did.

441
33:06.171 --> 33:07.556
That's a fact.

442
33:16.598 --> 33:18.391
Don't tell Eun Seo.

443
33:18.391 --> 33:19.391
Got it?

444
33:31.446 --> 33:33.907
- Looking for Jin Woo? - Yeah.

445
33:33.907 --> 33:37.202
He must have left his phone in his office.

446
33:37.202 --> 33:39.287
- Really? - Yeah.

447
33:39.287 --> 33:40.831
I'll go look for it.

448
33:40.831 --> 33:42.249
What?

449
33:42.249 --> 33:44.584
Go wait in the basement cafe for now, okay?

450
33:44.584 --> 33:45.585
Wait.

451
33:47.629 --> 33:50.340
The cafe. Got it? I'm off.

452
33:50.340 --> 33:52.044
What's with him?

453
33:53.343 --> 33:56.137
- Everything okay with Father? - Hello.

454
33:56.137 --> 33:57.264
Jin Woo.

455
33:57.264 --> 33:59.015
Eun Seo is here.

456
33:59.015 --> 34:00.184
Eun Seo?

457
34:05.856 --> 34:07.616
No wonder he's startled.

458
34:09.609 --> 34:11.361
But Tae Gyeong...

459
34:11.361 --> 34:13.697
What's with that look? Don't tell me...

460
34:13.697 --> 34:16.032
Are you two really seeing each other?

461
34:16.032 --> 34:19.244
No, Jin Woo. Let's talk later. Hurry and go see Eun Seo.

462
34:19.244 --> 34:20.537
- No. - What?

463
34:20.537 --> 34:23.999
- At least say hello before you go. - Say hello?

464
34:23.999 --> 34:25.333
Say hello.

465
34:25.333 --> 34:28.552
This is Moon Tae Gyeong, a junior of mine from Pediatrics.

466
34:33.967 --> 34:36.219
- The social worker? - Yes.

467
34:36.219 --> 34:38.388
- We meet again. - What?

468
34:38.388 --> 34:40.705
Have you two met before?

469
34:43.351 --> 34:46.474
Jin Woo. He caught me.

470
34:48.064 --> 34:50.025
Wait... you two are family?

471
34:50.025 --> 34:51.025
Yeah.

472
34:51.595 --> 34:53.297
This is my sister-in-law.

473
34:55.780 --> 34:57.778
Eun Seo's sister.

474
35:01.578 --> 35:04.539
So that's why you had me get her a bouquet?

475
35:04.539 --> 35:08.099
So that's why you gave me those flowers.

476
35:16.593 --> 35:18.094
Thank you.

477
35:28.521 --> 35:32.857
I really thought you were a fan.

478
35:33.371 --> 35:35.862
So it was Jin Woo's request.

479
35:35.862 --> 35:37.822
Well, I'm a fan now.

480
35:37.822 --> 35:41.576
You're Eun Seo's sister? Wow, I had no idea.

481
35:41.576 --> 35:43.114
You don't look alike at all.

482
35:43.114 --> 35:44.396
Not at all.

483
35:45.830 --> 35:47.832
Eun Seo doesn't know, does she?

484
35:47.832 --> 35:52.170
Only Jin Woo knew,

485
35:52.170 --> 35:55.099
but now one more person knows.

486
35:58.760 --> 36:00.512
Don't worry.

487
36:00.512 --> 36:02.126
I'll keep it a secret.

488
36:04.849 --> 36:07.825
Next show, I'll buy them myself.

489
36:08.979 --> 36:10.230
The bouquet.

490
36:10.230 --> 36:12.148
Really?

491
36:12.148 --> 36:13.148
Yes.

492
36:16.778 --> 36:20.349
Now, let's see if she looks natural when she sings.

493
36:24.479 --> 36:25.879
Looks good.

494
36:32.419 --> 36:34.419
But you don't look too happy.

495
36:35.380 --> 36:37.458
No, I'm fine.

496
36:38.758 --> 36:41.427
I just have a bit of indigestion.

497
36:43.722 --> 36:45.458
But, Do Hyeok.

498
36:57.979 --> 37:00.802
I wish someone would prick my finger to fix it.

499
37:03.160 --> 37:05.559
You wanted banana milk that badly?

500
37:06.661 --> 37:09.664
I might never get to drink it again.

501
37:09.664 --> 37:10.832
Gosh.

502
37:10.832 --> 37:12.282
There you go again.

503
37:13.251 --> 37:14.502
Just look at you.

504
37:14.502 --> 37:18.005
How can you be so different from Eun Seo?

505
37:19.257 --> 37:20.759
Come on.

506
37:20.759 --> 37:23.887
I've got a job, too, at a big company.

507
37:23.887 --> 37:26.181
You're just an intern.

508
37:26.181 --> 37:28.349
And you stayed out all night...

509
37:28.349 --> 37:29.738
My back.

510
37:31.019 --> 37:32.450
You punk.

511
37:33.157 --> 37:35.774
Aren't you ashamed

512
37:35.774 --> 37:38.234
to face your mother, even in a photo?

513
37:38.234 --> 37:42.505
Then I just won't look at Mom's photo.

514
37:43.031 --> 37:44.199
You little brat.

515
37:44.199 --> 37:45.866
Come here.

516
37:46.534 --> 37:49.798
Dad, stop trying to hit me! You're injured!

517
37:51.164 --> 37:55.627
Please pull yourself together and live like everyone else.

518
37:55.627 --> 38:00.111
Then I can die in peace.

519
38:00.923 --> 38:03.301
Don't talk about dying.

520
38:03.301 --> 38:04.969
If you're that lonely,

521
38:04.969 --> 38:08.681
stop looking at Mom's photo and just get remarried!

522
38:09.830 --> 38:14.604
It's just disc surgery, so what's all the fighting about?

523
38:14.604 --> 38:17.190
- You don't get it, Granny! - You don't get it, Granny!

524
38:20.693 --> 38:21.778
My back.

525
38:21.778 --> 38:23.696
I give up.

526
38:23.696 --> 38:28.243
A lifetime of banana milk wouldn't make you appreciate me.

527
39:12.917 --> 39:16.105
[NO PAIN]

528
39:18.877 --> 39:20.401
No Pain.

529
39:33.387 --> 39:35.249
[NO PAIN]

530
40:06.925 --> 40:08.384
Are you here to see me?

531
40:08.384 --> 40:09.510
Of course not.

532
40:09.510 --> 40:12.327
Just passing by. I was curious about this place.

533
40:13.264 --> 40:15.688
By coincidence. Purely by coincidence.

534
40:20.355 --> 40:22.368
You didn't drive here, did you?

535
40:25.526 --> 40:27.695
You seem to be in good shape.

536
40:32.659 --> 40:36.060
I mean, you seem to have recovered. After the accident.

537
40:37.789 --> 40:39.457
Yeah, well...

538
40:39.457 --> 40:41.245
I told you I was fine.

539
40:41.960 --> 40:43.336
By the way,

540
40:44.420 --> 40:45.546
do you play music?

541
40:46.381 --> 40:47.423
Hold on.

542
40:54.889 --> 40:56.025
It's me.

543
40:59.219 --> 41:01.286
[Pink Frankenstein]

544
41:10.839 --> 41:13.382
Don't even think about using your father as an excuse

545
41:13.382 --> 41:14.867
to skip work and goof off.

546
41:14.867 --> 41:16.453
Does he have trust issues?

547
41:17.287 --> 41:19.573
He's seriously a head case.

548
41:21.369 --> 41:23.593
- I'm so sorry. - It's okay.

549
41:27.005 --> 41:29.257
- Excuse me. - Yes?

550
41:29.257 --> 41:31.835
Did a big accident happen at the hospital?

551
41:31.835 --> 41:33.219
No.

552
41:33.219 --> 41:36.139
The chairman is coming for a medical checkup today.

553
41:36.139 --> 41:38.224
So all the doctors are on high alert.

554
41:38.224 --> 41:40.559
I see. Thank you.

555
41:42.353 --> 41:43.739
Wow.

556
41:44.480 --> 41:46.340
Talk about pulling rank.

557
41:47.233 --> 41:48.584
Wait...

558
41:49.610 --> 41:51.738
As in Seheon Group's chairman?

559
42:14.523 --> 42:16.703
[Rest in Peace]

560
42:28.524 --> 42:29.651
Quiet!

561
42:30.860 --> 42:33.780
Where is Mom going now?

562
42:33.780 --> 42:35.823
He will handle it.

563
42:35.823 --> 42:37.367
No!

564
42:37.367 --> 42:39.523
Don't make me give up on you too.

565
43:02.141 --> 43:05.478
The chairman of Seheon Group is coming to the hospital today.

566
43:05.478 --> 43:09.295
You're an executive there, so you must know the chairman, right?

567
43:14.278 --> 43:16.989
Aren't you going to check that?

568
43:16.989 --> 43:18.408
Later.

569
43:18.408 --> 43:19.408
Who is it?

570
43:23.371 --> 43:24.747
Is it a woman?

571
43:27.542 --> 43:29.709
If it's a woman, end it in three days.

572
43:44.267 --> 43:47.979
Where have you been wandering off to?

573
43:47.979 --> 43:50.815
Why do you act like this whenever I'm gone?

574
43:50.815 --> 43:53.524
Just bring me a banana milk and hurry back.

575
44:13.838 --> 44:15.256
Kwon Do Hyeok?

576
44:23.764 --> 44:26.309
Who's the hottie behind the chairman?

577
44:26.309 --> 44:28.728
He's the eldest son. Just back from abroad.

578
44:28.728 --> 44:30.482
He's gorgeous!

579
44:32.356 --> 44:33.441
The eldest son?

580
44:38.946 --> 44:40.121
Seheon Group.

581
44:43.951 --> 44:45.133
Kwon Tae Woong.

582
44:45.953 --> 44:47.079
Kwon Do Hyeok.

583
44:48.122 --> 44:50.369
Kwon Do Hyeok is the chairman's son?

584
44:55.296 --> 44:56.839
Kwon Do Hyeok

585
44:56.839 --> 44:59.175
is the eldest son of Seheon Group?

586
44:59.759 --> 45:01.844
Then that day...

587
45:01.844 --> 45:05.306
That's why he ruined my interview.

588
45:05.306 --> 45:06.759
Did you get the milk?

589
45:07.445 --> 45:09.279
- Yeah, yeah. - Give it here.

590
45:15.525 --> 45:17.027
Dad.

591
45:18.069 --> 45:19.445
Got any money?

592
45:19.445 --> 45:20.445
Money?

593
45:21.822 --> 45:23.354
Why do you need money?

594
45:24.367 --> 45:27.578
"Because I owe a dangerous rich heir money."

595
45:27.578 --> 45:29.239
I can't exactly say that.

596
45:31.207 --> 45:37.113
Can't you spare a little for your one and only youngest daughter?

597
45:39.090 --> 45:40.967
Of course I can.

598
45:40.967 --> 45:42.424
Come sit closer to me.

599
45:43.094 --> 45:45.179
Really? You will?

600
45:45.179 --> 45:46.180
Yeah.

601
45:49.392 --> 45:51.136
Turn clockwise.

602
45:51.769 --> 45:52.895
Clockwise?

603
45:56.771 --> 45:58.237
Dad! Dad!

604
45:58.237 --> 46:00.165
My back!

605
46:00.165 --> 46:03.293
Dad, you'll hurt yourself! You'll make it worse!

606
46:05.533 --> 46:07.034
Other people's kids

607
46:07.034 --> 46:10.663
buy their dads a present with their first paycheck.

608
46:10.663 --> 46:12.707
I'm not even asking for that.

609
46:12.707 --> 46:15.835
No, I really need it.

610
46:15.835 --> 46:19.088
Would I ask you for money if I weren't desperate?

611
46:19.088 --> 46:20.923
You think I'm not? Come here.

612
46:20.923 --> 46:23.801
I said, come here!

613
46:23.801 --> 46:29.015
It's just a slipped disc, so why's he still here making a fuss?

614
46:29.015 --> 46:33.269
We should move to another room. I really can't stand this.

615
46:33.269 --> 46:35.563
Father, how is your back?

616
46:35.563 --> 46:38.274
Father, you have a test this afternoon, so no eating.

617
46:38.274 --> 46:42.278
My blood sugar's low. I'll never last till the afternoon.

618
46:42.278 --> 46:47.199
See? I told you no milk, but you kept saying it was fine.

619
46:47.199 --> 46:48.951
You really have to fast.

620
46:48.951 --> 46:51.078
- Just hang in there, Father. - No, I...

621
46:51.078 --> 46:52.078
No.

622
46:59.295 --> 47:00.636
Hello, sir.

623
47:01.271 --> 47:02.684
Who is this?

624
47:03.341 --> 47:05.092
He's a junior colleague of mine.

625
47:05.092 --> 47:07.352
He's Moon Tae Gyeong, a pediatrician.

626
47:08.137 --> 47:10.239
He was Eun Seo's senior in high school.

627
47:11.599 --> 47:13.895
He's the star doctor at our hospital.

628
47:15.311 --> 47:16.812
You're too kind.

629
47:16.812 --> 47:19.106
- Sir, fasting must be tough. - Yes.

630
47:19.106 --> 47:21.108
You'll need to fast until this evening.

631
47:21.108 --> 47:22.401
I will.

632
47:22.401 --> 47:24.271
Jin Woo. Can we talk?

633
47:24.271 --> 47:26.527
- Is your back okay? - Yes, yes.

634
47:27.448 --> 47:28.949
- Jin Woo. - Yes?

635
47:28.949 --> 47:30.242
Kwon Do Hyeok.

636
47:30.242 --> 47:32.578
Is he the eldest son of Seheon Group?

637
47:32.578 --> 47:33.996
Yeah.

638
47:33.996 --> 47:35.331
Wait, you didn't know?

639
47:35.331 --> 47:38.250
How would I know when no one told me?

640
47:38.250 --> 47:39.960
Then how did you find out?

641
47:39.960 --> 47:43.255
I saw him at the hospital with the chairman this morning.

642
47:43.255 --> 47:46.425
Right, it's the chairman's checkup day.

643
47:46.425 --> 47:49.136
But Kwon Do Hyeok came with him?

644
47:49.136 --> 47:50.569
That's a first.

645
47:53.349 --> 47:55.935
I have a patient to see. Let's talk later.

646
47:55.935 --> 47:56.935
Okay.

647
47:57.687 --> 47:59.354
- See you. - Yeah.

648
48:01.619 --> 48:03.734
But...

649
48:03.734 --> 48:05.903
Kwon Do Hyeok,

650
48:05.903 --> 48:09.097
why isn't he replying?

651
48:21.627 --> 48:27.299
No texts, and obviously no calls.

652
48:27.299 --> 48:30.636
Why does she get under my skin?

653
48:33.764 --> 48:35.433
Can't sleep again, I see.

654
48:35.433 --> 48:37.331
I'll play some Brahms.

655
48:44.525 --> 48:45.602
Stop.

656
48:55.953 --> 48:57.413
Why are you calling so late?

657
48:57.413 --> 48:59.995
Did you not wait for me to call?

658
49:01.625 --> 49:03.502
Did you eat something bad?

659
49:03.502 --> 49:06.088
Yeah, I have indigestion.

660
49:06.088 --> 49:07.757
Sing me a song.

661
49:08.758 --> 49:11.469
You don't have indigestion. You sound drunk.

662
49:11.469 --> 49:14.054
Can't you just sing for me?

663
49:14.054 --> 49:16.925
If you want to hear it, come here yourself.

664
49:23.773 --> 49:27.109
You really are a slow learner.

665
49:27.109 --> 49:31.792
You still haven't learned not to mouth off to me.

666
49:46.587 --> 49:47.967
Pretty.

667
49:58.933 --> 50:00.618
Figures.

668
50:01.477 --> 50:03.692
It's all about Lee Eun Seo.

669
50:18.202 --> 50:19.453
Here.

670
50:21.413 --> 50:23.707
Dad is the chef on Sundays.

671
50:23.707 --> 50:25.459
Yay!

672
50:25.459 --> 50:26.964
It looks delicious.

673
50:46.054 --> 50:48.297
[Han Mi Yeong]

674
50:50.109 --> 50:52.194
No! I don't want to go.

675
50:52.194 --> 50:54.321
I'm going to stay with Mom.

676
50:54.321 --> 50:57.074
You can't miss your first day of school.

677
50:57.074 --> 51:00.745
You even practiced the school song with Mom.

678
51:04.456 --> 51:09.545
Sing it bravely and then come tell Mom all about it.

679
51:09.545 --> 51:10.545
Okay?

680
51:13.810 --> 51:15.315
Let's go now.

681
51:30.594 --> 51:32.144
Mom.

682
51:34.528 --> 51:35.946
Mom...

683
51:41.327 --> 51:43.162
Mom.

684
51:43.162 --> 51:45.431
Mom!

685
51:45.431 --> 51:47.391
Mom!

686
51:48.334 --> 51:52.206
I sang it bravely, just like you said!

687
51:53.631 --> 51:54.757
Mom!

688
51:56.133 --> 51:57.760
Mom!

689
51:58.719 --> 52:00.429
Mom!

690
52:27.998 --> 52:29.708
What now?

691
52:29.708 --> 52:31.210
Then come out and sing.

692
52:31.210 --> 52:32.670
What do you mean?

693
52:32.670 --> 52:34.922
You told me to come and listen.

694
52:34.922 --> 52:37.435
What, should I honk the horn or something?

695
52:41.303 --> 52:42.388
What?

696
52:43.389 --> 52:44.807
He's really here?

697
52:46.230 --> 52:47.350
For real?

698
53:09.039 --> 53:11.125
You're really here.

699
53:23.554 --> 53:25.806
Stop acting like a dog and wipe it up.

700
53:28.350 --> 53:30.144
Have you got bitten by one?

701
53:30.144 --> 53:31.520
I have.

702
53:31.520 --> 53:34.273
By a big dog, like a tiger.

703
53:34.273 --> 53:35.482
Really?

704
53:35.482 --> 53:37.110
When I was young.

705
53:37.110 --> 53:39.403
Was it a rabid dog?

706
53:39.403 --> 53:44.091
It was my father's dog. He eventually shot it dead, though.

707
53:44.091 --> 53:45.649
Shot it?

708
54:00.966 --> 54:03.052
Say something.

709
54:03.052 --> 54:05.012
I just wanted to hear your voice.

710
54:05.012 --> 54:07.806
Did something happen?

711
54:07.806 --> 54:10.934
If it did, would you do as I say?

712
54:10.934 --> 54:12.157
No way.

713
54:14.563 --> 54:18.192
How do I put it? Be loud. The Lee Eun Chae way.

714
54:18.192 --> 54:20.110
You have the weirdest taste.

715
54:21.361 --> 54:24.490
Hey! You jerk!

716
54:24.490 --> 54:25.743
Like this?

717
54:37.211 --> 54:41.329
Do you usually talk like that when you're dating women?

718
54:42.841 --> 54:45.886
Words were never necessary.

719
54:45.886 --> 54:48.486
If you didn't need words, then what...

720
55:07.616 --> 55:11.036
Do I look like a man

721
55:11.036 --> 55:13.657
who has nothing but money?

722
55:16.959 --> 55:22.266
Am I nothing but a nasty, obnoxious rich kid to you?

723
55:24.883 --> 55:27.136
It's not

724
55:27.136 --> 55:29.102
like that, but...

725
55:29.930 --> 55:31.764
Then can I kiss you?

726
56:54.710 --> 56:55.891
Lee Eun Chae?

727
56:55.891 --> 56:57.476
She's on a date.

728
56:57.476 --> 56:59.311
All you ever do is snap at me.

729
56:59.311 --> 57:01.939
Manager Kwon, please look after Eun Chae.

730
57:01.939 --> 57:03.065
You're the best!

731
57:03.065 --> 57:04.858
Snap out of it! If you smile, you lose.

732
57:04.858 --> 57:07.061
Why on earth would I be your woman?

733
57:07.061 --> 57:08.946
My father asked who you were,

734
57:08.946 --> 57:10.989
so I said you're the woman I'm seeing.

735
57:10.989 --> 57:13.367
Now is your chance to sign.

736
57:13.367 --> 57:15.702
How about changing Soo's image?

737
57:15.702 --> 57:18.163
Why are you doing this to me?

738
57:18.163 --> 57:19.623
Can I kiss you now?

739
57:19.623 --> 57:21.487
I've never asked before.
